度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>解法1</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(k)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解法2</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(k)</td>\n<td>中等规模</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"5-代码详解\"><a href=\"#5-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 代码详解\"></a>5. 代码详解</h3><h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> sys</span><br><span class=\"line\">    data = sys.stdin.read().split()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> data:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    k = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(data[<span class=\"number\">0</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    s = data[<span class=\"number\">1</span>].strip()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    n = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(s)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    cycle_len = n // k</span><br><span class=\"line\">    total_change = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    freq = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * <span class=\"number\">26</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(k):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        pos = j * cycle_len + i</span><br><span class=\"line\">        char_index = <span class=\"built_in\">ord</span>(s[pos]) - <span class=\"built_in\">ord</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        freq[char_index] += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        max_freq = <span class=\"built_in\">max</span>(freq)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        total_change += max_freq</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(total_change)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#5-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 逐行解析\"></a>5.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>关键变量</strong>：<code>k</code>, <code>s</code>, <code>n</code>, <code>cycle_len</code>, <code>total_change</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>核心逻辑</strong>：使用计数数组<code>freq</code>记录每个字符的出现次数，优先选择出现次数最多的字符。</li>\n<li><strong>边界条件</strong>：当<code>k</code>为1时，直接返回结果。</li>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>：确保输入数据格式正确。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-3-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#5-3-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.3 优化技巧\"></a>5.3 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>空间优化</strong>：使用固定大小的数组<code>freq</code>，避免动态扩容。</li>\n<li><strong>时间优化</strong>：预处理，计算每个字符的出现次数。</li>\n<li><strong>代码优化</strong>：增加注释，提高可读性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#6-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 复杂度分析\"></a>6. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>：O(n)，其中n是字符串长度。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>：O(k)，用于存储字符频率的数组。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度对比</strong>：与朴素方法相比，减少了不必要的比较。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#7-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 输入输出示例\"></a>7. 输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>：<code>s = &quot;aabbaa&quot;, k = 2</code></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>：<code>True</code></li>\n<li><strong>执行过程</strong>：首先计算每个字符的出现次数，然后选择出现次数最多的字符。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"8-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#8-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>8. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>：确保输入数据格式正确。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>：逐步跟踪代码执行过程，检查中间变量的值。</li>\n<li><strong>测试用例</strong>：使用不同长度和内容的字符串进行测试。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#9-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"9. 总结与扩展\"></a>9. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>：学会了使用计数数组和贪心策略解决字符串重复子串问题。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>：类似题目和拓展应用，如判断字符串是否为回文、判断字符串是否为对称等。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>：深入研究字符串处理、贪心算法等高级主题。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P8739","path":"api/tags/P8739.json"}]}